==English==

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{label|en|mathematics}} of a [[function]] of two or more [[variable]]s in which the [[ratio]] of the [[partial derivative]]s depends only on the ratio of the variables, not their [[value]]
# {{label|en|economics}} in which the ratio of [[goods]] demanded depends only on the ratio of their [[price]]s
# the relationship of a microcosm to a macrocosm

====Usage notes====
According to the extension of [[wikipedia:Wu wei|Wu wei]] theory, ordering the Chinese Emperor's palace ''is'' governing the country well: the palace is an homothetic reproduction of the country.

